&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;check sound&amp;nbsp;source&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;check if Motu 2 is default&amp;nbsp;Output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Switch &lt;span class="caps"&gt;ON&lt;/span&gt;/&lt;span class="caps"&gt;OFF&lt;/span&gt; Motu&amp;nbsp;2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check Settings Ableton Live -Audio-&amp;nbsp;M2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check volume settings, &lt;span class="caps"&gt;MOTU&lt;/span&gt; . Logitech speakers, sound source , In/Out in Guitar&amp;nbsp;Rig&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
