&lt;p&gt;I think I&amp;rsquo;m a fan of Chris Isaak for almost 30 years. Starting with probably his hit Wicked Game. I was never in the opportunity to visit one of his&amp;nbsp;concerts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On Tuesday 15 June 2010 I visited his concert in 013&amp;nbsp;Tilburg.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ballads, rock songs, some old work, some recent work, covers from Elvis, Roy Orbison, James Brown. It had it&amp;nbsp;all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lots of coverage on You&amp;nbsp;Tube.&lt;/p&gt;
